 <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EdVid AI - AI Powered Educational Video Platform</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #38bdf8;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .badge {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            color: #38bdf8;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .features {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            width: 220px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            color: #f1f5f9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .feature-card p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="badge">Powered by Claude 3.5 Models</div>
        <h1>Transform Educational Content into Engaging Videos</h1>
        <p>EdVid AI leverages advanced Claude LLM models to automatically convert text, lesson plans, and complex educational topics into script outlines, visual storyboards, and video production workflows.</p>
        
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Smart Scripting</h3>
                <p>Generates pedagogical scripts tailored for students.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Storyboard AI</h3>
                <p>Creates step-by-step visual scenes instantly.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <h3>Automation</h3>
                <p>Speeds up educational video creation process.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
